    <string name="agreement_screen_agreement_content">For using the smart phone/tablet PC application "JDS"\n\nWith this service, you can participate in the auction sponsored by JDS (Japanese circulation study meeting) from the smart phone/tablet PC application "JDS."\nPlease read and agree the Confirmation Items below, and you are authorized to use this service.\n
 \n
        [Confirmation Items]\n
        \n
        1. This service is proportionate to the agreements and regulations including the JDS (Japanese circulation study meeting) participation agreement, etc.\n\n
        2. About the usage fee and the bidding commissions, please ask JDS (Japanese circulation study meeting) operation office.\n\n
        3. The official state(flaws, etc.) of each item is based on the voice announcement at the auction site.\n\n
        4. Absence Bid cannot be made for an item of which the indication is corrected. Please attend a real-time auction.\n\n
        5. A bid is not allowed for the members who are banned from attending an auction by JDS (Japanese circulation study meeting) operation office and the members whose credit limit is under the start price.\n\n
        6. It is the members\' expense to purchase a smart phone and a tablet PC and to use the communication line.\n\n
        7. This service is NOT available in foreign countries.\n\n
        8. Please use this service at the spot where a radio wave condition is good.\n\n\n
        ※Under the following conditions, the application "JDS" may cause malfunctions. The auction sites and the service operating company DO NOT take any responsibility for members\' losses caused by the malfunctions.  Please be careful. \n\n
        * The contents display may be delayed while communication radio wave is weak and unstable, or while you move at high speed by trains, by cars, and etc.\n\n
        * It is likely that the communication radio wave is disconnected temporarily where the communication mode is switched over from Wi-Fi to public network, from LTE to 3G, and vice versa.\n\n
        * It is likely that this service is suspended temporarily in the following moments:\n
        　1. when your smart phone/tablet PC receives an incoming call.\n
        　2. when your smart phone/tablet PC receives an e-mail.\n
        　3. when the automatic screen rock function of your smart phone/tablet PC is activated.\n
        　4. the battery residual quantity of your smart phone/tablet PC is small.\n
        　5. when your smart phone/tablet PC receives a notification from other applications you use while the notification setting is ON. \n\n
        \n
        【Service Operating Company and Inquiry】\n
        \n
        RASIS SOFTWARE SERVICE CO., LTD.\n
        E-Mail : support_rca@rasis-soft.co.jp</string>

    <string name="agreement_HP_content">
        スマートフォン・タブレットアプリ「OneTouchAuction」ご利用について本サービスは、スマートフォンからOneTouchAuctionに参加できるサービスです。以下事項をご確認頂き、内容に合意の上ご利用頂けるものとします。\n\n

【 ご確認事項 】\n\n

1.本サービスの利用料金、また落札手数料については、GTM合同会社運営事務局へお問い合わせ下さい。\n
2.商品の状態（瑕疵等）は、商品詳細記載事項が基準となります。\n
3.表示に訂正がある商品は不在入札での応札はできません。リアル応札をご利用下さい。\n
4.GTM合同会社運営事務局よりセリへの参加を停止されている会員様のご利用、セリへの応札はできません。\n
5.スマートフォンの購入代金及び通信回線のご利用料金は会員様のご負担になります。\n
6.海外でのご利用はサポートしておりません。\n
7.通信状態の良い場所でご利用下さい。\n
※以下のような場合、誤動作の原因になります。誤動作により会員が被った損害につきましては、会場・運営会社は一切の責任を負いかねます。ご注意下さい。\n
・通信電波が届きにくい、弱い、または不安定な場所、電車、自動車等、高速移動中には、表示内容に遅延するおそれがあります。\n
・Wi-Fi 、公衆回線・通信方式（LTE、４Gなど）が切り替わる場合、通信が一時遮断されるおそれがあります。\n
・電話着信時、メール受信時、画面自動ロック時、バッテリー残量が少なった時、またお客様がご利用のアプリの通知設定がONで、通知が入った場合、本サービスが一時中断されるおそれがあります。\n\n

【運営会社・お問い合わせ先】\n\n

GTM合同会社\n
E-Mail : g-top.management@gmail.com\n

